# i-service-cache-updater — this piece's own operational targets.
#
# Included by the root Makefile (`include i-service-cache-updater/Makefile`),
# so every target here runs from the repository root, against the shared
# master .env — never `cd i-service-cache-updater && make`. What this
# component is and how to verify it: README.md.
#
# Nothing here yet: this service has no randomness of its own — it applies
# cdc.* changes to Redis verbatim — so it is unlikely to need much beyond
# what `make lag`/`make profile` (in the root Makefile) already cover.
